WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.707
When the doors open, be there for the
people who support your cause.

00:00:05.011 --> 00:00:10.853
Cause on Cue is VNV Events’ 2027 pilot for
South Florida nonprofits.

00:00:11.202 --> 00:00:16.258
We help produce your fundraiser and give
your guests a branded place to RSVP.

00:00:16.572 --> 00:00:20.235
That same list goes to your welcome desk
for check-in.

00:00:20.426 --> 00:00:23.696
At Victoria Venezuela Foundation’s charity
golf tournament,

00:00:23.966 --> 00:00:28.325
we brought the digital workflow together
with sound and on-site coordination.

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:34.414
Tell us about your next fundraiser.

00:00:34.751 --> 00:00:36.504
We’ll work out where we can help.
